script/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q1","e":"ing","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Van Rijswijk","x":"As you have seen and we've also made announcements again in the first quarter, I've made announcements in the fourth quarter on elements that we're looking at then what we are restructuring, so the first quarter we made announcement on the Czech Republic and Austria.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/ing-groep-ing-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q1","e":"ing","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Omar Fall","x":"In particular, are you ready now to give us some guidance on the potential scale of future restructuring costs or should we just assume something in the region of the levels this quarter going forward for a few more periods?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/ing-groep-ing-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q2","e":"ing","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven van Rijswijk","x":"We have made a number of announcements of actions that we're taking including branch reductions, restructuring of private banking in the Netherlands, branch increases in various other countries including Poland and Belgium.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/ing-groep-ing-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q2","e":"ing","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven van Rijswijk","x":"As soon as you announce them, it still means that you do-you go through a period of restructuring, you have a discussion with the worst councils and unions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/ing-groep-ing-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven van Rijswijk","x":"And I'll take the questions on restructuring costs and fees on prepayment and near quarter on quarter, I will leave it to today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/ing-groep-ing-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven van Rijswijk","x":"On restructuring costs and restructuring, Czech Republic is completed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/ing-groep-ing-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Johan Ekblom","x":"This increased guidance on negative deposit pricing for next year, does that mean that there is an incremental benefit into Q4 or into Q1 on the kind of Q3 run rate?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/ing-groep-ing-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q4","e":"ing","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Van Rijswijk","x":"What I guide on is the -- of course, excluding these restructuring amounts if they would come.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/04/ing-groep-ing-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2021 Q4","e":"ing","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Van Rijswijk","x":"We've done quite a bit of restructuring in 2021 with Czech Republic, Austria, France, also provisioned some of the branch networks in the Benelux.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/04/ing-groep-ing-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2026 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Unknown Analyst","x":"Should we expect as well some ramp-up on costs in terms of investments in AI, tech within the next plan?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ing-ing-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2026 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ida Lerner","x":"We are not commenting on our expectation of pass-through, but what we also mentioned initially is that it continues to be a strong competition in the market and in our key markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ing-ing-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2026 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Delphine Lee","x":"And how much pass-through should we have on the tailwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ing-ing-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2026 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ida Lerner","x":"This required EUR 63 million of restructuring costs in the third quarter and will result in EUR 40 million of annual cost savings once fully implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ing-ing-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2026 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ida Lerner","x":"And as Stephen already announced, -- for the fourth quarter, we expect additional restructuring costs, including the EUR 175 million as announced today in Wholesale Banking.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ing-ing-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ING 2026 Q3","e":"ing","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Steven van Rijswijk","x":"As I said, having raised our outlook for return on tangible equity by an additional 2 percentage points compared to the original target of 27%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ing-ing-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[37,1,11818,0,0,0,9445,1830],[38,1,16019,0,0,0,12641,2771],[39,1,14088,0,0,0,10467,2982],[40,1,13567,0,0,0,10890,2130],[41,1,8746,0,0,0,7580,681],[42,1,15270,0,0,0,11922,2711],[43,1,14030,0,0,0,10209,3153],[44,1,13478,0,0,0,9991,2854],[45,1,10153,0,0,0,7583,2029],[46,1,10006,0,0,0,7617,1753],[47,1,9642,0,0,0,7230,1883],[48,1,14004,0,0,0,9819,3489],[50,1,4450,0,0,0,3507,573],[67,